	{MessageHistory
		{message_0x0
			{author "<c(green)>上尉"}
			{portrait "/interface/scene/portrait/narrator_fin_officer"}
			{text "欢迎来到东卡累利阿，少校！\n 这是你的新战地指挥部。必须不惜一切代价保护它！< > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < >"}
		}
		{message_0x1
			{author "<c(green)>上尉"}
			{portrait "/interface/scene/portrait/narrator_fin_officer"}
			{text "你的任务是切断敌人的逃跑路线。\n 之后，摧毁敌军防守部队！< > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < >"}
		}
		{message_0x2
			{author "<c(green)>上尉"}
			{portrait "/interface/scene/portrait/narrator_fin_officer"}
			{text "设置路障，采用“莫蒂”战略！< > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < >"}
		}
		{message_0x3
			{author "<c(green)>上尉"}
			{portrait "/interface/scene/portrait/narrator_fin_officer"}
			{text "开始夺取目标，\n 同时我们会为你提供一些增援部署！< > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < > < >"}
		}
		{message_0x4
			{author "<c(green)>士兵"}
			{portrait "/interface/scene/portrait/narrator_fin_soldier"}
			{text "我们的增援来了！"}
		}
		{message_0x5
